excerpt: In the rapidly evolving field of viral genomics, selecting the appropriate computational framework for phylogenetic analysis is as critical as the data itself. Following a recent [**Journal Club**](/journal-club/baltic-python-based-phylogenetic-tree-visualisation-module/) presentation, members of the RdRp Slack community engaged in a technical exchange that provided a snapshot of the current software landscape used by experts to reconstruct and visualize evolutionary histories.
